# Scheduled-only policy/VLA-private Global -> Pipeline dispatch protocol.
# Perception and voice retain their own typed inputs/results; action_chunk is
# a policy action output, not a generic model result container.
# session_id/request_id are UUID4; request_id is scoped to the logical session
# generation. Global sends the positive logical_generation returned by Open.
# The binding guard treats logical_generation=0 as the current bound generation;
# Global does not use that alias for Dispatch. No new generation is created.
# binding_id, positive binding_incarnation, and expected_boot_id must match Open.
# operation_id is a UUID4 identifying this downstream operation, echoed back.
# Ledger key: (session_id, logical_generation, request_id). Duplicates preserve
# the entire payload (including deadline and operation_id) to wait/replay;
# changed payload conflicts. Only NOT_STARTED permits a fresh execution retry.
# Cancellation is cooperative and backend-dependent; it may be rejected.
# Accepted cancellation or caller timeout does not prove device completion.
# UNKNOWN forbids retry/fallback until ownership is resolved by drain/boot fence.
# Observation sample time in the Pipeline ROS clock domain; zero selects now.
builtin_interfaces/Time obs_timestamp
string<=4096 prompt
string<=36 request_id
string<=36 session_id
uint64 logical_generation
string<=36 binding_id
uint64 binding_incarnation
string<=36 operation_id
string<=36 expected_boot_id
# Positive generation returned by private Open. Zero cannot pass admission.
uint64 expected_pipeline_generation
# Required positive absolute UTC Unix deadline; zero is invalid. Global resolves
# public defaults before forwarding. Local waits use a monotonic clock budget.
builtin_interfaces/Time deadline
# Public priority 0..7, bounded by max_supported_public_priority and hardware levels.
int32 priority
---
ibrobot_msgs/VariantsList action_chunk
int32 chunk_size
int32 execution_horizon                  # Optional executable prefix; zero means full chunk
bool success
float64 inference_latency_ms
float64 backend_latency_ms
string<=36 request_id
string<=36 session_id
uint64 logical_generation
string<=36 binding_id
uint64 binding_incarnation
string<=36 operation_id
string<=36 boot_id
string<=63 pipeline_id
uint64 pipeline_generation
string<=64 deployment_fingerprint
string<=64 runtime_policy_fingerprint
ibrobot_msgs/InferenceOutcome outcome
ibrobot_msgs/ScheduledInferenceError error
---
string<=128 status
